{"created": "2026-10-06T11:04:53.125702+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-06T11:04:53.434594+00:00", "id": 23186348, "conceptrecid": "23186347", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23186348", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23186347", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23186348", "metadata": {"title": "agb-linkage: Chinese listed-company location and biomass linkage tools", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23186348", "publication_date": "2026-10-06", "description": "<p>Version 0.1.0 of agb-linkage provides reproducible software for auditing company-location tables and extracting summaries from annual aboveground biomass rasters supplied by the user. It offers an explicitly defined historical angular-grid square specification and a separate geodesic circle specification based on raster-cell centres, with declared coordinate reference, validity, raw-zero and scaling policies.</p>\n<p>The archive contains original source code, configuration, tests, reproducibility documentation and fictitious synthetic demonstration inputs. It excludes the manuscript, third-party biomass rasters, company-address exports, saved geocoding responses and the recovered real company-year linkage. It is a software record, not a released dataset of Chinese listed-company observations. The MIT licence applies to original project software, associated documentation and synthetic inputs; it does not grant rights to third-party inputs or the real matched panel.</p>\n<p>The companion measurement manuscript remains an unpublished review draft. Source identity, coordinate placement, units and zero/mask interpretation still require independent real-data validation. Software tests and demonstrations do not establish ecological validity or redistribution rights for real results. The GitHub repository is currently private.</p>\n<p>Frozen source commit: 89c22458b2c4808ad6f96d70068f4b0aff7c0d46. The software ZIP contains 42 files copied unchanged from that commit, with the entire paper directory excluded. ZIP SHA-256: 5493090aa138c65e7827f43f483ec6018afd9a41bfec5688e96564ba71852e7d.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Wang, Yueyang", "affiliation": "Cardiff University"}], "version": "0.1.0", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/Jill0099/agb-linkage"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "mit-license"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23186347"}}]}}, "title": "agb-linkage: Chinese listed-company location and biomass linkage tools", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23186348", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23186348", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23186348?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23186348", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23186348", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23186348", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23186348/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23186347", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23186347", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23186347", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23186347", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23186348/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23186348/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23186348/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23186348/media-files", "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23186348/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23186348/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23186348/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23186348/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23186348/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23186348/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23186348/access/links", "acc